+### F1 — explicit per-game `hwContext` override (commit `02af461`, +1 file test, 2 files edited)
+`overrides.go`: `GameOverride` gains a `hwContext string json:"hwContext"` field; `GameHwContext(gameKey)` returns `"gl"/"vulkan"` (any other value → `""`, so a typo can't pin a game onto a nonexistent context); `ResolveHwContext(gameKey, coreDefault)` is the pure 3-level precedence decision.
